Subject: Generate declared scalar and oneOf response bodies

Jane 6.3.9 records scalar and oneOf response schemas as null and decodes
oneOf bodies into untyped values. This patch derives the declared PHP types,
validates oneOf branches, and deserializes successful responses into models.

